[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.080]   Thank you, Anna, and welcome to the Nextdoor Media Group Second Quarter 2020 Results Call.
[00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:06.740]   Today's call is being recorded.
[00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:10.800]   I would now like to turn the conference over to Joe Giuffani, Investor Relations.
