[00:00:58.480 --> 00:01:01.860]   whether as a result of new information, future events, or otherwise.
[00:01:01.860 --> 00:01:05.820]   With that, it's now my pleasure to turn the conference call over to your host,
[00:01:05.820 --> 00:01:08.880]   Nextdoor Chairman, President, and CEO, Terry Sook.
[00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:09.980]   Terry, please go ahead.
[00:01:09.980 --> 00:01:13.360]   Thank you, Joseph, and good morning, everyone.
[00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:17.980]   Thank you all for joining us to review Nextdoor's record second quarter results today.
