[00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:57.220]   Nextdoor's industry leader, Tom Carter, is on the call with me this morning.
[00:02:57.240 --> 00:03:00.660]   As the world continues to address the health and economic challenges
[00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:03.880]   brought on by the pandemic, the strength of our business model
[00:03:03.880 --> 00:03:07.700]   and enterprise-wide focus on managing operations for free cash flow
[00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:12.040]   enabled us to bring about 21% of every net revenue dollar
[00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:13.400]   to the free cash flow line.
[00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:16.340]   In the year-to-date period, Nextdoor has generated
